                        "sense_id": "8619e885-6590-3517-b034-ea97fa5f3980",
                        "entry_id": "5ecadee1-7966-370c-b52b-bd20a7c48504",
                        "glosses": [
                            "beeldspraak waarbij aan niet menselijke zaken, menselijke eigenschappen worden toegeschreven"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dff2cb2c-3abc-41aa-acc1-67bb5cfb9662",
                                "sense_id": "8619e885-6590-3517-b034-ea97fa5f3980",
                                "text": "De sprekende koffiepot in Belle en het Beest is een personificatie."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f9881224-dc98-39ed-ac09-3322675d79fe",
                        "entry_id": "5ecadee1-7966-370c-b52b-bd20a7c48504",
                        "glosses": [
                            "van een mens zeggen dat hij de vertegenwoordiger is van een abstract begrip"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3d8dbc9-19d6-4556-8989-e6380a9552d8",
                                "sense_id": "f9881224-dc98-39ed-ac09-3322675d79fe",
                                "text": "Mijn leraar is de personificatie van het kwaad."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "80f0a935-ec84-45d6-9c3f-6036996c945a",
                                "sense_id": "f9881224-dc98-39ed-ac09-3322675d79fe",
                                "text": "George Soros is de personificatie van Aurel Kolnais definitie van het Westen. Hij is alles wat rechtse volksmenners en antisemieten haten: rijk, een wereldburger, Joods, en een vrijdenker die gelooft in de ‘open samenleving’, in de geest van Karl Popper, eveneens een Joodse zoon van het Hongaars-Oostenrijkse imperium."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8e138c06-6b84-427c-bd2c-e4ea8312fda0",
                                "sense_id": "f9881224-dc98-39ed-ac09-3322675d79fe",
                                "text": "Mnuchin is ex-bankier van Goldman Sachs, de bank die in campagne van Trump de personificatie was van de elite die de gewone man een oor aannaait. Daarnaast had hij een hedgefonds, financierde hij Hollywoodfilms en heeft hij zo'n 40 miljoen dollar op de bank. Zijn waarde wordt op zo'n 500 miljoen dollar geschat."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a4266689-2c31-4dc7-91e2-213afb0a6907",
                        "source_entry_id": "5ecadee1-7966-370c-b52b-bd20a7c48504",
                        "source_sense_id": "8619e885-6590-3517-b034-ea97fa5f3980",
                        "source_sense_description": "van een mens zeggen dat hij de vertegenwoordiger is van een abstract begrip",
                        "target_lang_word": "epitome",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "epitome",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eed286f5-193b-37bc-beb0-ba7ddbfb4f53",
                                        "entry_id": "cd6e3f1c-565e-3763-989e-3634c3e6d616",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The embodiment or encapsulation of a class of items."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23bb3221-e99a-4e95-9001-54309b5b8ae3",
                                                "sense_id": "eed286f5-193b-37bc-beb0-ba7ddbfb4f53",
                                                "text": "This is a poore Epitome of yours, / Which by th'interpretation of full time, / May ſhew like all your ſelfe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3848a37e-e603-4bcf-adac-aecd5395da7f",
                                                "sense_id": "eed286f5-193b-37bc-beb0-ba7ddbfb4f53",
                                                "text": "But first I took up Ayesha's kirtle and the gauzy scarf with which she had been wont to hide her dazzling loveliness from the eyes of men, and, averting my head so that I might not look upon it, covered up that dreadful relic of the glorious dead, that shocking epitome of human beauty and human life."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9beba6d1-8b07-32a7-80b8-18d2fdcea10b",
                                        "entry_id": "cd6e3f1c-565e-3763-989e-3634c3e6d616",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A representative example."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "faf3e127-9821-4c5e-8495-2f2e66036e92",
                                                "sense_id": "9beba6d1-8b07-32a7-80b8-18d2fdcea10b",
                                                "text": "The minute they see me, fear me / I'm the epitome of \"public enemy\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66905f78-3e17-35d6-b33a-adbde972e8ac",
                                        "entry_id": "cd6e3f1c-565e-3763-989e-3634c3e6d616",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The height; the best; the most vivid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91986bbc-819c-45f9-9fbf-f2860d81766a",
                                                "sense_id": "66905f78-3e17-35d6-b33a-adbde972e8ac",
                                                "text": "He looks the very epitome of fright: I do not think he could eat one of those apples, if it were given him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1eb4835a-57ef-387d-934c-45d9cf454fe3",
                                        "entry_id": "cd6e3f1c-565e-3763-989e-3634c3e6d616",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A brief summary of a text."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdfbdb9b-ba35-41f5-ac57-8dfeac40c5a2",
                                                "sense_id": "1eb4835a-57ef-387d-934c-45d9cf454fe3",
                                                "text": "Having now so amply declared unto thee most of the principal things of this thrice-renowned and illustrious city, I will briefly by way of an epitome mention most of the other particulars thereof, and so finally shut up this narration: there are reported to be in Venice and the circumjacent islands two hundred churches in which are one hundred forth-three pairs of organs, fifty-four monasteries, twenty-six nunneries, fifty-six tribunals or places of judgment, seventeen hospitals, six companies or fraternities, whereof I have before spoken; one hundred and sixty-five marble statues of worthy personages, partly equestrial, partly pedestrial, which are erected in sundry places of the city, to the honour of those that either at home have prudently administered the commonweal, or abroad valiantly fought for the same."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
